/ A car in its color, a guest an icon in the width of the car icon. A
  session that is not assigned is an open task, like a proposal in the
  list.
- if state == :unassigned
  = render ChargingSession::ReviewBadge::Component.new(label:)
- else
  span class=css_class title=title
    - if color
      = car_icon(color)
    - elsif state == :guest
      = helpers.icon 'user', class: 'shrink-0 w-[1.25em] opacity-60'
    span.truncate = label
